      "content": "it’s just that everyone keeps saying \"it gets better\" or \"you did your best\" but it doesn't feel like it. it feels like i just wasted years for nothing. like i'm just empty. i feel like there's no point in even trying to keep going when i've already failed so hard. it’s just so much easier to just let go.\n Balance the emotions of and the feeling that the weight",
